WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.089
The CHART study compared Rezvi or bicalutamide plus ADT in high-volume mHSPC.

2
00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:07.198
The median OS was 78.8 versus 44.8 months,

3
00:00:07.263 --> 00:00:11.530
and rPFS was 81 versus 18.5 months, both favoring the Rezvi combination.

4
00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:15.854
ORR was 81% versus 68%, also favoring Rezvi plus ADT.

5
00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:19.253
Common treatment-related adverse events included weight gain and hypertriglyceridaemia.

